Patch 0001 (scope-reduction) of fid-clarabel, spec node KRN.SOLV.CONIC.PATCH.

Scope reduction: keep the zero, nonnegative and second-order cones and the QP objective; remove the exponential, power, generalized power and PSD cones (and the chordal decomposition and dense BLAS/LAPACK code only they use), the Python and Julia bindings, FFI, printing, timers, JSON file I/O, termination callbacks, the faer and Pardiso LDL back ends, every optional feature, and the upstream CI, packaging and build configuration (.github/, .cargo/, build.rs, Cargo.lock, pyproject.toml); rename the package to fid-clarabel; upstream unit tests and doc examples are replaced by the kernel tests in ../tests/.

Rule IDs and rationale: vendor/fid-clarabel/AUDIT.toml.

